(7286691, 1135746, 13077, '<td valign="top">I expected the star of the "after" scene to be upside down!<br/>But those stairs don''t look very comfortable to lie on, so I can''t blame you.</td>', 'I expected the star of the "after" scene to be upside down!But those stairs don''t look very comfortable to lie on, so I can''t blame you.', '2014-11-21 00:23:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7286692, 1135750, 13077, '<td valign="top">I like the relative scale of each scene, and the harsh light and processing works very well for the concept.</td>', 'I like the relative scale of each scene, and the harsh light and processing works very well for the concept.', '2014-11-21 00:24:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7286693, 1135745, 13077, '<td valign="top">Instant afro, change of clothes, disappearing glasses and darkened world? I''ll have to try a bottle of that!</td>', 'Instant afro, change of clothes, disappearing glasses and darkened world? I''ll have to try a bottle of that!', '2014-11-21 00:25:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7286694, 1135567, 13077, '<td valign="top">Cool - I like the slight diagonal angle of the line between the two scenes. Good light as well.</td>', 'Cool - I like the slight diagonal angle of the line between the two scenes. Good light as well.', '2014-11-21 00:25:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7286695, 1135777, 13077, '<td valign="top">Super cool.<br/>Something about the transition between frames bugs me, though - mainly the lower half. I don''t know if fading them in somehow or just using a more bold border would have helped. No points off the score for it, though - good concept and kudos on being willing to get messy for a cool shot.</td>', 'Super cool.Something about the transition between frames bugs me, though - mainly the lower half. I don''t know if fading them in somehow or just using a more bold border would have helped. No points off the score for it, though - good concept and kudos on being willing to get messy for a cool shot.', '2014-11-21 00:27:46.000000', NULL, 1),
