(7287039, 1135759, 19825, '<td valign="top">This is well done. However, I might have liked to see a bit more personality captured in the shots -- but maybe you were going for more aof a mugshot look.</td>', 'This is well done. However, I might have liked to see a bit more personality captured in the shots -- but maybe you were going for more aof a mugshot look.', '2014-11-22 09:13:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7287073, 1135774, 60173, '<td valign="top">Both quality photos in their own right.<br/> <br/>I get that the left photo is the meant to be your dark side or whatever, but I would have liked to see more detail in the coat. You''re going for dark side, not evil-jump-out-of-the-shadows-murderer, right? Also, I would have flipped these and gone "Day &amp; Night", because it matches the challenge description better (...and I''m anal like that).</td>', 'Both quality photos in their own right. I get that the left photo is the meant to be your dark side or whatever, but I would have liked to see more detail in the coat. You''re going for dark side, not evil-jump-out-of-the-shadows-murderer, right? Also, I would have flipped these and gone "Day & Night", because it matches the challenge description better (...and I''m anal like that).', '2014-11-22 13:34:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7287074, 1135737, 60173, '<td valign="top">Overall, pretty good, though I do have some critiques: <br/> <br/>You probably should have moved to the bathroom for the second shot. <br/> <br/>Also, if you want the image to stand alone, is there anything on that pouch that describes what this product is? I had a hunch what I was looking at, but wasn''t sure until I looked it up. Currently, I can''t really read anything on the pouch other than "MoviPrep" and "Salix".</td>', 'Overall, pretty good, though I do have some critiques:  You probably should have moved to the bathroom for the second shot.  Also, if you want the image to stand alone, is there anything on that pouch that describes what this product is? I had a hunch what I was looking at, but wasn''t sure until I looked it up. Currently, I can''t really read anything on the pouch other than "MoviPrep" and "Salix".', '2014-11-22 13:39:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7287075, 1135770, 60173, '<td valign="top">The first photo is effective. Conceptually, the second photo is also effective, but the execution doesn''t work for me. <br/> <br/>Lighting in the second photo seems really bright and harsh. It looks like areas of your neck were blown out and have no detail (right under your chin is getting pixelated especially), and there''s dark spots on your chin and nose where you seem to be masking (get it? haha) glaring highlights.</td>', 'The first photo is effective. Conceptually, the second photo is also effective, but the execution doesn''t work for me.  Lighting in the second photo seems really bright and harsh. It looks like areas of your neck were blown out and have no detail (right under your chin is getting pixelated especially), and there''s dark spots on your chin and nose where you seem to be masking (get it? haha) glaring highlights.', '2014-11-22 13:45:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7287076, 1135753, 60173, '<td valign="top">I really like how you''ve carried the tote into both photos.</td>', 'I really like how you''ve carried the tote into both photos.', '2014-11-22 13:46:12.000000', NULL, 1),
