(7287081, 1135749, 60173, '<td valign="top">I like that you''ve brought attention to the "Be Happy" sign above your head in the second one. Your happy faces looks a little unsure of itself. Though, that''s understandable seeing where you came from in the cranky and tired "before" photo. Both photos a bit too contrasty for my taste, but the message is well conveyed and the editing is consistent.</td>', 'I like that you''ve brought attention to the "Be Happy" sign above your head in the second one. Your happy faces looks a little unsure of itself. Though, that''s understandable seeing where you came from in the cranky and tired "before" photo. Both photos a bit too contrasty for my taste, but the message is well conveyed and the editing is consistent.', '2014-11-22 13:59:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7287082, 1135567, 60173, '<td valign="top">I like the angled divide choice. I would have cloned out the dust spot in the "clean" photo that is above your head. Also, I think I see an umbrella in your glasses.</td>', 'I like the angled divide choice. I would have cloned out the dust spot in the "clean" photo that is above your head. Also, I think I see an umbrella in your glasses.', '2014-11-22 14:01:21.000000', NULL, 1),
