(7287178, 1135775, 124982, '<td valign="top">A nice tutorial on how to post-process a portrait...although a little too over-cooked for my tastes. The skin looks unrealistic/plastic (needs some texture and pores for realism), and the eye is over-sharpened. You''ve made yourself look like a mannequin. Probably 2/3 of this effect would have been ideal.</td>', 'A nice tutorial on how to post-process a portrait...although a little too over-cooked for my tastes. The skin looks unrealistic/plastic (needs some texture and pores for realism), and the eye is over-sharpened. You''ve made yourself look like a mannequin. Probably 2/3 of this effect would have been ideal.', '2014-11-23 14:16:54.000000', NULL, 1),
