(7289486, 1135775, 56502, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by RyanW:</b></div><hr/><i> Harsh!<br/>Skin smoothing, tone shifting I see; adding make-up I do not see.<br/>There are no shadings present in the after that are not there in the before (emphasised or toned down some, but not created from nothing).</i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>The eye lashes on her left eye towards the temple definitely were not there on the left shot, so this is added, and in my point of view the DQ is okay, considering the rules.<br/> <br/>DQ or no DQ - I still think it''s a great job that was done here, and a nice take on the challenge topic.</td>', 'Originally posted by RyanW: Harsh!Skin smoothing, tone shifting I see; adding make-up I do not see.There are no shadings present in the after that are not there in the before (emphasised or toned down some, but not created from nothing).  The eye lashes on her left eye towards the temple definitely were not there on the left shot, so this is added, and in my point of view the DQ is okay, considering the rules. DQ or no DQ - I still think it''s a great job that was done here, and a nice take on the challenge topic.', '2014-12-03 08:02:44.000000', NULL, 0),
